    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "真假孙悟空激斗掀起的狂风消歇、白茫茫的雪雾散开，诸神抬头望去，风雪散开处什么也没有。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000039.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000039",
          "chapter_order": 39,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "被两根金箍棒搅起来的狂风也消歇了下去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "李靖一回头发现孙悟空就在身边，惊得把手里的塔扔了出去，那塔扣在太白金星头上。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000039.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000039",
          "chapter_order": 39,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "李靖一回头，啊一声吓得手里的塔也飞了出去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "李靖跳出几十丈远，问对方是「哪个孙悟空」；孙悟空答「孙悟空还有几个」，并伸棒把李靖顶了个跟头。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000039.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000039",
          "chapter_order": 39,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "将李靖顶个跟头"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "巨灵神凑到太上老君耳边低声说话，被孙悟空抡棒像打球一样扫到天上，重重摔下来。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000039.txt",
